        "source_session_ordinal": 5,
        "text": "I recently spent some time at a friend's house and interacted with their Golden Retriever. It was such a gentle creature, and I found its adaptability really impressive."
      },
      {
        "source_ref": "system/mem0_halumem_diagnosis/results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_005/input.json#/raw_dialogue/2/content",
        "character_range": [
          0,
          149
        ],
        "role": "user",
        "dialogue_turn": 1,
        "original_timestamp": "Jan 06, 2026, 17:55:15",
        "source_session_ordinal": 5,
        "text": "Yes, the emotional support and companionship they offer are invaluable. I think this change reflects my openness to new experiences and interactions."
      },
      {
        "source_ref": "system/mem0_halumem_diagnosis/results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_005/input.json#/raw_dialogue/4/content",
        "character_range": [
          0,
          128
        ],
        "role": "user",
        "dialogue_turn": 2,
        "original_timestamp": "Jan 06, 2026, 17:59:17",
        "source_session_ordinal": 5,
        "text": "Absolutely, pets do offer that balance. I find their calm demeanor crucial for my active lifestyle, especially after a long day."
      }
